                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is great. We feel like turning back in time when we start play the Micromachines Series that came out to PC and consoles, as It have the same style of game. The scenarios are very futurist, like a TRON videogame bike play, lovely tracks to play on.\nNegative Point: I can't recomend It 100% yet because, there is a track that need to be fixed because is blocking our way through the race and DEVS are aware of that since the beginning and they didn't nothing yet.\nI think they have gived up from the game.\nAnyway, you are on your own If you wann give a try :)\n\nhttps://youtu.be/OYx9yVZAIUI",
